WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
A G1 robot stands beside a padded incline, attached to an overhead safety tether. An operator holding the gantry controller stands to the left.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
The robot takes steps forward onto the padded surface.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The robot bends its torso and lowers a handheld tool toward the surface. The operator and safety equipment remain in view.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.000
The robot begins to raise its torso. The selected silent excerpt ends before the later trial outcome.
